      "content": "That's a solid foundation. One specific area I want to expand on in the training is how managers can identify \"bad actors\"—people who aren't just struggling with their tasks, but who seem to be intentionally disruptive or even subtly sabotaging the team's culture. How should a manager identify these types of individuals versus just someone who needs more training, and how should that distinction be documented?",
